record ImageData { pixels : Seq( Seq( nat * nat * nat ) ) height : nat width : nat } enumeration VisionModel { DimModel NormalModel BrightModel } record EstimatedPosition { topLeft : nat * nat bottomRight : nat * nat uncertainty : real } record ScrewImageData { position : real * real * real orientation : real * real * real image : ImageData screwsDetected : Seq( EstimatedPosition ) } enumeration AdaptationPlan { NewModel ( VisionModel ) MoveDown StopRobot }